<title>TURKEY: Turkish leftist leader backs Yilmaz coalition bid.</title>
<headline>Turkish leftist leader backs Yilmaz coalition bid.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Turkish leftist leader said on Tuesday he would support an effort by secularist Mesut Yilmaz to put together an anti-Islamist coalition.</p>
<p>&quot;We are in favour of giving a vote of confidence to the new government,&quot; leader Deniz Baykal told a meeting of his Republican People's Party deputies.</p>
</text>
